(6476523, 962431, 12611, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sculpture or graffiti piece.Love the shadow up top, hope its real and not part of the underlying artwork. overall, the shot is excellent.</td>', 'Looks like a sculpture or graffiti piece.Love the shadow up top, hope its real and not part of the underlying artwork. overall, the shot is excellent.', '2011-07-20 09:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
