(6476525, 962613, 10785, '<td valign="top">Such a good concept. The fact that the reflection of the blue background is all over the metal really kills this. That metal shield and the cap badge need to be crisp and silver and shiny. I am not sure if you are using a blue light or not but I think this could have been done on white and it would have really gotten the point across.</td>', 'Such a good concept. The fact that the reflection of the blue background is all over the metal really kills this. That metal shield and the cap badge need to be crisp and silver and shiny. I am not sure if you are using a blue light or not but I think this could have been done on white and it would have really gotten the point across.', '2011-07-20 09:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476527, 962334, 12611, '<td valign="top">Ominous as all get-out; the square crop may not be wise however.</td>', 'Ominous as all get-out; the square crop may not be wise however.', '2011-07-20 09:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
