(6479559, 962613, 114225, '<td valign="top">While I like the idea, I feel the photo needs a bit of work. The first thing that drew my eye was the hat and the badge on it. But being out of focus my mind went instantly to "not quite right". then I see the crease that runs throughout the photo, which is highlight distracting. I hope this helps.</td>', 'While I like the idea, I feel the photo needs a bit of work. The first thing that drew my eye was the hat and the badge on it. But being out of focus my mind went instantly to "not quite right". then I see the crease that runs throughout the photo, which is highlight distracting. I hope this helps.', '2011-07-23 20:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
