(6479656, 963018, 97225, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I feel like I could be traveling along on this ride and spending the time contemplating my fellow commuters. My interest switches from the foreground man to the girl glimpsed between other travelers, around the rest of the carriage and back again. I like the grain and incomplete desaturation too. There are some beautiful entries in this challenge, but this one engages me the most.</td>', 'I really like this. I feel like I could be traveling along on this ride and spending the time contemplating my fellow commuters. My interest switches from the foreground man to the girl glimpsed between other travelers, around the rest of the carriage and back again. I like the grain and incomplete desaturation too. There are some beautiful entries in this challenge, but this one engages me the most.', '2011-07-23 23:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6479657, 962520, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and charming shot.</td>', 'Beautiful and charming shot.', '2011-07-23 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6479990, 963005, 135204, '<td valign="top">To me the borders don''t add to this and the composition of the shot is not very interesting.  The light seems overly harsh, maybe a different time of day or adjusting the white balance would improve it.</td>', 'To me the borders don''t add to this and the composition of the shot is not very interesting.  The light seems overly harsh, maybe a different time of day or adjusting the white balance would improve it.', '2011-07-24 14:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480246, 962861, 112736, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more post production, but what a catch!  You don''t see that every day.</td>', 'Needs a bit more post production, but what a catch!  You don''t see that every day.', '2011-07-24 21:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480247, 963048, 112736, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually into this style of shot, but I really dig this one for some reason. Maybe the whites could be a touch whiter or so, but very cool.</td>', 'I''m not usually into this style of shot, but I really dig this one for some reason. Maybe the whites could be a touch whiter or so, but very cool.', '2011-07-24 21:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480253, 963181, 112736, '<td valign="top">Though I''m a monster car nut, this isn''t really a R.O.T picture. It''s all too balanced throughout the shot, instead of being weighted in 1/3. (At least how my high school photo teacher put it. :-)  However, I did drool a bit, so you get some points for that. lol</td>', 'Though I''m a monster car nut, this isn''t really a R.O.T picture. It''s all too balanced throughout the shot, instead of being weighted in 1/3. (At least how my high school photo teacher put it. :-)  However, I did drool a bit, so you get some points for that. lol', '2011-07-24 21:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480259, 962448, 112736, '<td valign="top">Lol, my wife looks about the same right now, and something like this crossed my mind, but never got it done.  I like it!</td>', 'Lol, my wife looks about the same right now, and something like this crossed my mind, but never got it done.  I like it!', '2011-07-24 21:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480260, 962597, 112736, '<td valign="top">Yes.  This is the way to do a r.o.t. landscape shot.  The wheat looks great, and the sky is an excellent color.</td>', 'Yes.  This is the way to do a r.o.t. landscape shot.  The wheat looks great, and the sky is an excellent color.', '2011-07-24 21:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480261, 962471, 112736, '<td valign="top">She''s adorable.  And MY eyes are drawn to the blue in this, not just the red.  Although, for the portfolio, I''d use a little selective color and then clone out that hair on the bridge of her nose.  Good job.</td>', 'She''s adorable.  And MY eyes are drawn to the blue in this, not just the red.  Although, for the portfolio, I''d use a little selective color and then clone out that hair on the bridge of her nose.  Good job.', '2011-07-24 21:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
