(6482064, 963187, 132177, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but already at least the third differen challenge with the same style. Annoying.</td>', 'Great photo, but already at least the third differen challenge with the same style. Annoying.', '2011-07-27 03:29:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482077, 962617, 114233, '<td valign="top">I''m shocked to see this shot end up this low. I can only assume that it wasn''t blue enough for most of the voters. I guess to some it also looks like centred composition due to where the floor is positioned but it fits thirds for me because of where the focus is - the face. This is a super image taken by someone that knows what he is doing!</td>', 'I''m shocked to see this shot end up this low. I can only assume that it wasn''t blue enough for most of the voters. I guess to some it also looks like centred composition due to where the floor is positioned but it fits thirds for me because of where the focus is - the face. This is a super image taken by someone that knows what he is doing!', '2011-07-27 03:38:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482086, 962523, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Margaret. Nice going. Gosh those birds must have sat still for you!</td>', 'Congratulations Margaret. Nice going. Gosh those birds must have sat still for you!', '2011-07-27 03:53:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482091, 962523, 75713, '<td valign="top">Well, Well, it is very similar to your other image I liked so much and it really packs a punch with so much blue .. I am really enjoying seeing your body of work especially because you haven''t been here all that long and you are getting ribbons galore.  Now I really can''t wait to see what you bring back from your balloon expedition and I expect great things - I really doubt that you will let something such as fear of heights stop you because you have found your ... sweet spot :)  Loving it .. you go girl!</td>', 'Well, Well, it is very similar to your other image I liked so much and it really packs a punch with so much blue .. I am really enjoying seeing your body of work especially because you haven''t been here all that long and you are getting ribbons galore.  Now I really can''t wait to see what you bring back from your balloon expedition and I expect great things - I really doubt that you will let something such as fear of heights stop you because you have found your ... sweet spot :)  Loving it .. you go girl!', '2011-07-27 04:19:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482098, 963186, 75713, '<td valign="top">There could be 9000 more glass shots and I will enjoy each one because they are all as unique as a landscape, seascape or any other type of shot... unique according to the photographers vision of it .. I am enjoying your take on this glass shot .. wonderfully done, suits the challenge, beautifully photographed and congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'There could be 9000 more glass shots and I will enjoy each one because they are all as unique as a landscape, seascape or any other type of shot... unique according to the photographers vision of it .. I am enjoying your take on this glass shot .. wonderfully done, suits the challenge, beautifully photographed and congratulations on your ribbon.', '2011-07-27 04:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482099, 963175, 75713, '<td valign="top">Just an amazing photo .. creative, beautifully photographed and I like your interpretation of this challenge. Congratulations!</td>', 'Just an amazing photo .. creative, beautifully photographed and I like your interpretation of this challenge. Congratulations!', '2011-07-27 04:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482100, 962431, 75713, '<td valign="top">Perfectly  meets the challenge, wonderful, interesting textures, crisp focus, fascinating shadows ... what 3 idiots gave this a 3? I won''t tell you what I think about the people who gave you a 4 vote (grin)  No I don''t try to win popularity contests .. I just love this shot and congratulations on placing 6th .. doing my happy dance for you!  By the way, it''s a rumba!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-27 03:53:21.</i></td>', 'Perfectly  meets the challenge, wonderful, interesting textures, crisp focus, fascinating shadows ... what 3 idiots gave this a 3? I won''t tell you what I think about the people who gave you a 4 vote (grin)  No I don''t try to win popularity contests .. I just love this shot and congratulations on placing 6th .. doing my happy dance for you!  By the way, it''s a rumba!', '2011-07-27 04:29:42.000000', '2011-07-27 04:53:21.000000', 0),
(6482101, 963186, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! A lovely shot, well done.</td>', 'Congratulations! A lovely shot, well done.', '2011-07-27 04:29:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482103, 963175, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. Beautifully executed.</td>', 'Congratulations. Beautifully executed.', '2011-07-27 04:32:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482104, 962334, 75713, '<td valign="top">I have to admit I thought this would place higher although the front page is nothing to sneeze at unless you are allergic to an unjust 2 and a 3 vote (even a 4 on this shot)on a photo that meets the challenge perfectly, is beautifully photographed, is interesting, has drama, is unusual, meets technical guidelines such as rule of thirds etc, wonderfully pped ...but what the heck - you made the front page, congratulations! ahchoo - where is my claritin?</td>', 'I have to admit I thought this would place higher although the front page is nothing to sneeze at unless you are allergic to an unjust 2 and a 3 vote (even a 4 on this shot)on a photo that meets the challenge perfectly, is beautifully photographed, is interesting, has drama, is unusual, meets technical guidelines such as rule of thirds etc, wonderfully pped ...but what the heck - you made the front page, congratulations! ahchoo - where is my claritin?', '2011-07-27 04:37:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482105, 962523, 101668, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. A beautiful and powerful image</td>', 'Congratulations. A beautiful and powerful image', '2011-07-27 04:41:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482106, 963186, 101668, '<td valign="top">Congrats. Next time its a blue. You were outdone by sheer brilliancy from Margaret''s side but this is just as wonderful</td>', 'Congrats. Next time its a blue. You were outdone by sheer brilliancy from Margaret''s side but this is just as wonderful', '2011-07-27 04:43:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482107, 963077, 75713, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the front page for this shot .. it''s a great street shot (of which I stink at) It meets the challenge.. it has all the elements of a good story, a sad one but that''s OK as DP often has too many rainbows and flower stories .. I love the pattern of the bricks she is walking on.. the fact that her face and body are a silhouette really make for a better composition.. what is the b/g?  I love that I don''t know and I can make up my own story about it .. just an amazing street shot and I am so glad to see it on the front page.</td>', 'Congratulations on the front page for this shot .. it''s a great street shot (of which I stink at) It meets the challenge.. it has all the elements of a good story, a sad one but that''s OK as DP often has too many rainbows and flower stories .. I love the pattern of the bricks she is walking on.. the fact that her face and body are a silhouette really make for a better composition.. what is the b/g?  I love that I don''t know and I can make up my own story about it .. just an amazing street shot and I am so glad to see it on the front page.', '2011-07-27 04:45:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482108, 963175, 101668, '<td valign="top">I gave you an 8 Real good technique Congrats</td>', 'I gave you an 8 Real good technique Congrats', '2011-07-27 04:45:56.000000', NULL, 0),
