(6482158, 963188, 121916, '<td valign="top">This one got my 10.  The subtle tones and lines are beautiful.</td>', 'This one got my 10.  The subtle tones and lines are beautiful.', '2011-07-27 09:07:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482159, 963186, 118154, '<td valign="top">Congrats,nicely done.</td>', 'Congrats,nicely done.', '2011-07-27 09:07:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482160, 963175, 118154, '<td valign="top">Top shot,Congratulations.</td>', 'Top shot,Congratulations.', '2011-07-27 09:09:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482188, 963077, 100831, '<td valign="top">I picked this entry as outstanding from day one on my first go round. I finally got around to voting yesterday and gave it a 9 but didn''t have time to comment!  This is such a great street shot but I''ll admit to not picking it as yours because of both the blatant color and the open space. Maybe in your mind they go together!  <br/>I''m wondering (and no I don''t care) if you changed any colors to achieve this.... It fits together so perfectly!</td>', 'I picked this entry as outstanding from day one on my first go round. I finally got around to voting yesterday and gave it a 9 but didn''t have time to comment!  This is such a great street shot but I''ll admit to not picking it as yours because of both the blatant color and the open space. Maybe in your mind they go together!  I''m wondering (and no I don''t care) if you changed any colors to achieve this.... It fits together so perfectly!', '2011-07-27 09:40:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482189, 962597, 100831, '<td valign="top">Lovely.... high mark from me!</td>', 'Lovely.... high mark from me!', '2011-07-27 09:44:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482191, 962362, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really?  People are so lame.</td>', 'Really?  People are so lame.', '2011-07-27 09:44:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482197, 962341, 100831, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe the score on this one:). Geez.<br/>I love it!</td>', 'I cannot believe the score on this one:). Geez.I love it!', '2011-07-27 09:48:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482199, 963202, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> The sun needed to be on a thirds crossing, as your palm leaves creates more of a half, not a third, in the yin/yang sense, if you know what I mean. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, I understand what happened here, I think. I didn''t place my subjects on a set of crosshairs. I do find I use the ROT in a more subtle manner, which usually is a good thing in other challenges, where strict compliance with that technique is not being evaluated. Thanks for the feedback.</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: The sun needed to be on a thirds crossing, as your palm leaves creates more of a half, not a third, in the yin/yang sense, if you know what I mean.  Yes, I understand what happened here, I think. I didn''t place my subjects on a set of crosshairs. I do find I use the ROT in a more subtle manner, which usually is a good thing in other challenges, where strict compliance with that technique is not being evaluated. Thanks for the feedback.', '2011-07-27 09:51:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482200, 963000, 100831, '<td valign="top">8 from me.  Love the richness and that deep shadow. Very nice!</td>', '8 from me.  Love the richness and that deep shadow. Very nice!', '2011-07-27 09:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482201, 963014, 135330, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot! I like the Crown!!! Best Wishes!</td>', 'Nice Shot! I like the Crown!!! Best Wishes!', '2011-07-27 09:53:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482230, 963179, 69008, '<td valign="top">This looks like a fun thing to do!  The high angle is nice to show what''s going on in the kayak.  <br/>IMHO, it would have more appeal if they were paddling toward the camera coming in from the top, so that you could see the expressions on their faces.  Mid-day sunlight makes the colors strong, but contrast harsh as well.   <br/>Re your photographer''s comment; It''s a good sharp, colorful, image, but just not a "grabber". It does meet the challenge criteria, perfectly. <br/> If they were paddling straight up a 100 ft waterfall, it would be outstanding.  :  )</td>', 'This looks like a fun thing to do!  The high angle is nice to show what''s going on in the kayak.  IMHO, it would have more appeal if they were paddling toward the camera coming in from the top, so that you could see the expressions on their faces.  Mid-day sunlight makes the colors strong, but contrast harsh as well.   Re your photographer''s comment; It''s a good sharp, colorful, image, but just not a "grabber". It does meet the challenge criteria, perfectly.  If they were paddling straight up a 100 ft waterfall, it would be outstanding.  :  )', '2011-07-27 10:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6482232, 963202, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by capretta:</b></div><hr/><i> nice work on not blowing out the sun/sky, but i felt the photo could have used a little something else? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>A flaming zeppelin? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Done. Thanks for the suggestions.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=964140" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_964140.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_964140.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_964140.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Originally posted by capretta: nice work on not blowing out the sun/sky, but i felt the photo could have used a little something else?  A flaming zeppelin?  Done. Thanks for the suggestions.', '2011-07-27 10:42:12.000000', NULL, 0),
