(6482909, 963170, 62187, '<td valign="top">I gave you photo a 7. I like the fact that the ''blue'' was the background with a strawberry as the ''rule of thirds'' object. To me, a little out of the box - whatever that is! but I like it. To improve the score? Heck, I not know. Maybe a different perspective rather then from straight above. Or maybe a naked girl or a baby? I lived in Labrador for a while - a little North of you - Blueberries grew wild by the bucket full. And, it was a beautiful place to be: and very cold too! This is a strange place as well...you did good...better then 50%!<br/></td>', 'I gave you photo a 7. I like the fact that the ''blue'' was the background with a strawberry as the ''rule of thirds'' object. To me, a little out of the box - whatever that is! but I like it. To improve the score? Heck, I not know. Maybe a different perspective rather then from straight above. Or maybe a naked girl or a baby? I lived in Labrador for a while - a little North of you - Blueberries grew wild by the bucket full. And, it was a beautiful place to be: and very cold too! This is a strange place as well...you did good...better then 50%!', '2011-07-28 00:06:07.000000', NULL, 0),
