(6484714, 962612, 135492, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by grahamgator:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like this image.  Imo, it could be a ittle sharper, however, I really like the composition. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, this is my first ever submission to the site, so I am actually rather pleased it wasn''t right at the bottom of the list!<br/> <br/>I realised when I put it on the computer that the focus was a little out, and I''d have preferred the handle to have been in focus more. I''d have also liked a more ''blue'' colour, but I am still learning the camera and post processing techniques. There is a basis of a really good image here, I need to go back and try it again!</td>', 'Originally posted by grahamgator: I really like this image.  Imo, it could be a ittle sharper, however, I really like the composition.   Thanks, this is my first ever submission to the site, so I am actually rather pleased it wasn''t right at the bottom of the list! I realised when I put it on the computer that the focus was a little out, and I''d have preferred the handle to have been in focus more. I''d have also liked a more ''blue'' colour, but I am still learning the camera and post processing techniques. There is a basis of a really good image here, I need to go back and try it again!', '2011-07-30 07:49:17.000000', NULL, 0),
